            ---
            const title = "Evento Globolo";
            const description = "Create once, coordinate everywhere, and grow real-world communities.";
            ---
            <!doctype html>
            <html lang="en">
              <head>
                <meta charset="UTF-8" />
                <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
                <meta name="description" content={description} />
                <title>{title}</title>
                <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
                <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
                <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
                <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
              </head>
              <body>
                <div class="noise"></div>
                <header>
                  <a class="brand" href="/"><i></i>{title}</a>
                  <nav aria-label="Primary">
                    <a href="#product">Product</a><a href="#principles">Principles</a><a class="pill" href="#contact">Join the launch</a>
                  </nav>
                </header>
                <main>
                  <section class="hero">
                    <p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR REAL-WORLD OPERATIONS</p>
                    <h1>Create once, coordinate everywhere, and grow real-world communities.</h1>
                    <p class="lede">A focused platform with clear state, dependable automation, and a human handoff whenever judgment matters.</p>
                    <div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#contact">Get early access <b>↗</b></a><a class="secondary" href="#product">Explore the system</a></div>
                    <div class="signal"><span></span><p><strong>Foundation ready.</strong> Rust services, typed clients, edge infrastructure, and operational telemetry.</p></div>
                  </section>
                  <section class="cards" id="product"><article><span>01</span><h3>Publish from one source</h3><p>Keep the canonical event in Evento Globolo, then distribute through supported provider APIs.</p></article>
<article><span>02</span><h3>Respect every platform</h3><p>Capability-aware adapters use native automation where allowed and guided handoffs where it is not.</p></article>
<article><span>03</span><h3>Watch work happen</h3><p>Live job status, retries, provider receipts, and reconciliation make cross-posting observable.</p></article></section>
                  <section class="manifesto" id="principles">
                    <p>OUR OPERATING PRINCIPLE</p>
                    <h2>Automate the repetitive work.<br/>Keep consequential decisions visible.</h2>
                    <div class="metrics"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Canonical source of truth</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Idempotent workflows</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Observable outcomes</span></div></div>
                  </section>
                  <section class="contact" id="contact"><div><p>EARLY ACCESS</p><h2>Help shape the first release.</h2></div><a href="mailto:hello@evento-globolo.com">hello@evento-globolo.com <b>↗</b></a></section>
                </main>
                <footer><span>© 2026 {title}</span><span>Built deliberately.</span></footer>
              </body>
            </html>
